<!--
  BMChat persistent / foreground-service status icon. Drawn as a single
  white-tinted "B" silhouette (system tints status-bar icons regardless of
  the source colour). The legacy raster `notification_permanent.png` files
  in `drawable-{m,h,xh,xxh}dpi/` carried Delta Chat's "δ" mark, which leaked
  into the always-on status-bar icon used by `FetchForegroundService` /
  `KeepAliveService` / `GenericForegroundService`. Switching to a single
  vector here lets every density resolve to the BMChat brand mark without
  shipping per-density rasters.
-->
